{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792621200, "covers_from": "2026-10-21T22:20:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-21T22:21:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792621260, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-21T22:20:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 26037, "sprite_key": "deer_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "觀光", "content": "臺北已經沒有什麼景點好玩，外國朋友來都不知道怎麼好好介紹，西門町很多店感覺都是只想賺陸客錢，很沒質感", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.26,037", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-21T22:20:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 17933, "sprite_key": "turtle_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "長照", "content": "長者行動不便，公寓3樓都更，屢次失敗\n上下樓靠爬梯機，費用卻為負擔\n失智長輩共病多，申請不到居服", "display_name": "大安代表 No.17,933", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-21T22:20:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 8205, "sprite_key": "bear_business", "district": "nangang", "topic": "其他", "content": "我是驕傲的天龍人，沒想過現在中南部發展超過台北，然後台北市問題一大堆，營養午餐還會中毒，真的丟臉", "display_name": "南港代表 No.8,205", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-21T22:20:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 8773, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "民生社區活動中心外面明明有吸煙區，但還是很多人在旁邊巷子抽菸🤡形同虛設還犧牲了很多ubike停靠站", "display_name": "松山代表 No.8,773", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 17933, "sprite_key": "turtle_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.17,933", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 8205, "sprite_key": "bear_business", "display_name": "南港代表 No.8,205", "district": "nangang", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 8773, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "display_name": "松山代表 No.8,773", "district": "songshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 7430, "sprite_key": "penguin_busi